>
> "The mindflayer reaches ..." You die. Do you want your possessions
> identified?
>
> I'm starting to have real issues with the quest. Please, someone tell
> me I'm on the right path to ascension.

Of course you are, getting to the Quest is an important milestone. When
you get the Orb of Fate, its half damage instrinsic will be useful until
the end.

Wands of death and mindflayers are usual adversaries. The only death
specific to the quest is stepping into lava. I am always extremely careful
when stepping around lava, and indeed I prefer to be levitating to be
protected for accidental missteps.

One thing to keep in mind for the Val quest is that there are drawbridges
on the lowest level which can kill you instantly. You might want to crash
them with a wand of striking and levitate over the lava, or you wake up
Lord Surtur and let him carry the Bell and the Orb out of his castle.

